{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國聯邦政府指示文職機構，移除中國人工智能(AI)「深度求索」DeepSeek模型，亦禁止採購相關服務，以免美國資料外洩到中國。中方批評美方有關做法。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人毛寧表示：「中方一貫反對泛化國家安全概念，將科技經貿問題政治化，我們將堅決維護中國企業的合法權益。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:01:49.643797+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T13:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T14:57:48.483445+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T13:57:45.658037+00:00","content_hash":"6cb165e1c7f40b540fe92181deb78a7744ab27d911435e783ebc9038e126f669","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}